  "title": "FSSAI suspends and issues notice to Radisson Blu over food safety and hygiene violations",
  "summary": "The Food Safety and Standards Authority of India (FSSAI) has suspended and issued a notice to Radisson Blu, an e-commerce platform, to address its failure to meet food safety and hygiene standards. The regulator directed the hotel to take immediate corrective actions and submit evidence to support the suspension. The notice highlights issues like rusted machinery, poor refrigeration, and inadequate cleaning.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "FSSAI suspended Radisson Blu's license due to failure to comply with food safety and hygiene requirements.",
      "confidence": 0.95
